  "description": "Jet 4 MDB: qgdm held TableDefs collection fetched BEFORE DAO mutations: (1) verify db.TableDefs returns same COM identity; (2) DAO TableDefs.Append('T1') -> check held tds.Count, tds.Item('T1'), enumeration BEFORE Refresh, then after Refresh; (3) hold t1=tds.Item('T1'), DAO TableDefs.Delete('T1') -> check held tds.Count, tds.Item('T1'), t1.Name BEFORE Refresh, then after Refresh; (4) Append('T2') via a second getter variable tds2, check held tds.Count & tds.Item('T2') BEFORE Refresh; (5) rename t2.Name='T2Ren' -> check held tds.Item('T2') vs tds.Item('T2Ren') & Count BEFORE and AFTER Refresh. Keeps all pages.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
